The data on $\Delta \Phi_{L-X}$ for Pd$_{40}$Ni$_{40}$P$_{20}$ (a), Pt$_{42.5}$Cu$_{27}$Ni$_{9.5}$P$_{21}$ (b)  and Zr$_{35}$Hf$_{13}$Al$_{11}$Ag$_{8}$Ni$_{8}$Cu$_{25}$ (c) alloys  are taken from  Refs \cite{Wilde1994,Lu1999}, \cite{Neuber2021} and \cite{Ohashi2022}, respectively. 
