        \item the set \(\{U_i: i\in \omega\}\) of components of \(S^{n+1}\setminus X\) forms a sequence such that \(diam(U_i)\rightarrow 0\)
        \item \(S^{n+1}\setminus U_i\) is an \(n+1\) cell for each \(i\).
