\begin{abstract}
We show that every $n$-vertex planar graph is 3-colourable with monochromatic components of size $O(n^{4/9})$. The best previous bound was $O(n^{1/2})$ due to Linial, Matou{\v{s}}ek, Sheffet and Tardos [\emph{Combin. Probab. Comput.}, 2008].
\end{abstract}

