The following theorem completely classifies $n$ such that $D_n$ is planar. 

\begin{prop}
The graph $D_{n}$ is planar if and only if one of the following holds:
\begin{enumerate}
\item $n = p^{r},\ p$ prime, $0 \leq r \leq 3$ 
\item $n = pq,\ p,q$ prime 
\item $n = p^{2}q,\ p,q$ prime
\end{enumerate}
\end{prop}

