\mathbf{1}_{1,12}D^{-1}\mathbf{1}_{12,1}=[\mathbf{0}_{1,6}\ \mathbf{1}%
_{1,6}]D^{-1}\mathbf{1}_{12,1}=\mathbf{1}_{1,12}D^{-1}\left[ 
