        \item\label{pnfs3} $\cat C$ admits a stable factorisation system of the form $\bigl(\NEpi,\rcl\bigr)$ for some class $\rcl$ of arrows in $\cat C$.
        \item\label{pnfs4} $\cat C$ admits a stable factorisation system of the form $\bigl(\lcl,\TKer\bigr)$ for some class $\lcl$ of arrows in $\cat C$.
